      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm kinda scared of the er costs tbh. if i take some tylenol or maybe some ibuprofen it'll help the pain right? i just wanna get through the night without it hurting so much. is it safe to just dose up on some painkillers and sleep it off?",
